### Create order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Đơn 200 Bình gốm họa tiết sen men lam cao 35cm, yêu cầu nung nhiệt độ cao 1280°C, hoàn thành trong 10 ngày"}

### Analyze
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/analyze

### Create batch after review/confirm
POST http://localhost:8080/api/batches/from-order/1?actor=demo

### Complete current stage
POST http://localhost:8080/api/batches/1/steps/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{"operator":"worker-01","notes":"Completed normally"}

### QC sample 5% defect -> rework
POST http://localhost:8080/api/batches/1/qc
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantityInspected":200,"quantityPassed":190,"quantityFailed":10,"defectType":"Cracked glaze","severity":"HIGH","notes":"Requires rework","operator":"qc-01"}

### Rework from glazing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/batches/1/rework
Content-Type: application/json

{"targetStage":"GLAZING","operator":"manager-01","notes":"Re-glaze defective items"}

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/summary

### SSE
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stream
